    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>L'Atelier De Croustille is located on avenue Maréchal Lyautey, in Cavalaire-sur-Mer, for grooming your dog during your stay in the Gulf of Saint-Tropez. The salon opened recently (official "Grand opening" posts on Facebook and TikTok @latelierdecroustille), with advertised services including bath, tailored cut and coat care — still few reviews online given how young the business is, which is normal rather than a warning sign.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>Hours are a bit particular: open Tuesday to Friday from 9am to 6pm, Monday afternoon only (2-6pm), and Saturday morning (9am-2pm). Closed on Sunday.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: avoid Sunday and double-check the reduced Monday and Saturday hours before heading over.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The centre of Cavalaire-sur-Mer is close by, on the same avenue as several other businesses in the area.</p>
